\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 The October 13, 2026 City Commission Regular Meeting was called to order at 5:13 p.m. Alexis Givings, City Clerk, called the roll and the following were present:\par
\par
Present: 4 - Vice Mayor Angela Burns, Deputy Vice Mayor Tom Markert, Commissioner Juli Casale and Commissioner Judy Mollica\par
\par
Following the roll call, Ms. Gelin asked for a motion to allow the Mayor to participate telephonically. Deputy Vice Mayor Markert made the motion, seconded by Commissioner Casale. \par
\par
all were in favor\par
\par
Telephonically: 1 - Mayor Thomas Carney, Jr.\par
\par
Others present were:\par
Terrence Moore, City Manager\par
Lynn Gelin, City Attorney\par
Alexis Givings, City Clerk\par
}
